F7B5 3606             (    forth6809.asm):07087                     PSHU  D
F7B7 3620             (    forth6809.asm):07088                     PSHU  Y
F7B9 39               (    forth6809.asm):07089                     RTS
F7BA CC0000           (    forth6809.asm):07090         SNNOTFOUND: LDD   #0
F7BD 3606             (    forth6809.asm):07091                     PSHU  D
